---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LegalPage from "../../components/sections/Legal/LegalPage.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/sections/Footer/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Kersivo"
  description="How Kersivo collects, uses, and protects your personal information. UK-based web design and development studio."
>
  <LegalPage
    title="Privacy Policy"
    lead="How we handle your information when you visit this website or get in touch with us."
    updated="March 2026"
  >

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      Kersivo is a UK-based web design and development studio. We build premium, performance-first websites
      for small businesses across the United Kingdom. You can reach us at
      <a href="mailto:hello@kersivo.co.uk">hello@kersivo.co.uk</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What information we collect</h2>
    <p>We only collect information you provide directly to us. This includes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your name and email address when you submit an enquiry via our contact form</li>
      <li>Any project details or notes you choose to include in a message</li>
      <li>Your phone number, if you opt in to a callback request</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We do not collect sensitive personal data. We do not require account registration.
    </p>

    <h2>How we use your information</h2>
    <p>Information submitted through our contact form is used solely to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Respond to your enquiry</li>
      <li>Discuss and scope a potential project</li>
      <li>Follow up if you have asked us to</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We will never sell, rent, or share your personal details with third parties for marketing purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics and website data</h2>
    <p>
      We may use privacy-respecting analytics to understand how visitors use this website — for example,
      which pages are most visited or where traffic comes from. Any analytics we use are configured
      to anonymise IP addresses and do not build personal profiles of individual visitors.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not use advertising networks or third-party tracking pixels.
    </p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      Enquiry data is retained only as long as necessary to manage our conversation and any resulting
      project engagement. If you would like your information removed at any point, simply email us and
      we will delete it promptly.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under UK data protection law, you have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Access the personal information we hold about you</li>
      <li>Request correction of any inaccurate data</li>
      <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
      <li>Withdraw any consent you have given</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      To exercise any of these rights, email us at
      <a href="mailto:hello@kersivo.co.uk">hello@kersivo.co.uk</a>.
      We aim to respond within 5 working days.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page reflects when
      it was last revised. Continued use of this website after any changes constitutes acceptance
      of the updated policy.
    </p>

    <div class="k-legal__contact">
      <div class="k-legal__contact-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
          <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/>
          <path d="M3 7l9 7 9-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="k-legal__contact-body">
        <span class="k-legal__contact-label">Questions about this policy?</span>
        <p class="k-legal__contact-text">
          Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@kersivo.co.uk">hello@kersivo.co.uk</a> —
          we reply within 12 hours on business days.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </LegalPage>

  <Footer showTopCta={false} />
</BaseLayout>
